&\text{Cyclohexane (regular) \rightarrow \text{twisted-bone-conformed cyclohexane (with } D_2 \text{ symmetry)} \\
&\quad \quad \quad \quad \quad \quad \quad \quad \rightarrow \text{two bulky alkyl chains attached to opposite carbons} \\
&\quad \quad \quad \quad \quad \quad \quad \quad \rightarrow \text{alkylation chains are linked to form a ring} \\
&\quad \quad \rightarrow \text{twistane",fluency,"# Task Description
