- \(\ddot{x}\) is the acceleration,
- \(\Gamma\) is the damping coefficient,
- \(\dot{x}\) is the velocity,
- \(\omega_0\) is the natural frequency of the oscillator,
- \(x\) is the displacement from equilibrium.

