\]  
Convert the volume to m³:  
\[
4 \text{ L} = 4 \times 10^{-3} \text{ m}^3
\]  
Now, calculate \( T \):  
\[
T = \frac{(202650 \text{ Pa})(4 \times 10^{-3} \text{ m}^3)}{(2 \text{ mol})(8.314 \text{ J/mol·K})} = \frac{810.6}{16.628} \text{ K} \approx 48.8 \text{ K}
